// redirected. `amount` is pinned to the seeded balance so the generated action closes the asset
// balance, letting the post-withdraw health check run with no remaining oracle accounts.
// SAFETY CHECK: the extra marginfi account and bank are fresh non-PDA Keypairs minted by their
// real init instructions in SCOUT:SETUP-GLUE; no other instruction is init-gated on those concrete
// random pubkeys. `destination_token_account` is never `init`ed by marginfi (all occurrences are
// externally supplied token accounts), and `bank_liquidity_vault_authority` is only a PDA check.
// LendingAccountWithdraw.marginfi_account = self.withdraw_marginfi_account
// LendingAccountWithdraw.bank = self.withdraw_bank
// LendingAccountWithdraw.destination_token_account = self.signer_token_account
// LendingAccountWithdraw.bank_liquidity_vault_authority = Pubkey::find_program_address(&[LIQUIDITY_VAULT_AUTHORITY_SEED, bank.as_ref()], &self.program_id).0
