// MarginfiAccountSetKeeperCloseFlags.bank_keys_opt = self.scout_order_keeper_close_keys()

// --- update_group_rate_limiter / update_deleverage_withdrawals: keeper-shaped batches -------
// Both are permissionless-in-shape but exactly-sequenced: `update_seq` must be the successor of
// the group's own counter and the slot window must open after the last batch, close no later
// than now, and sit within 1_500 slots of it (update_group_rate_limiter.rs:29-46,
// update_deleverage_withdrawals.rs:29-48). Raw fuzzed u64s satisfy none of that -- measured
// 35/35 and 17/17 dispatches rejected. The three cursor args are therefore read back from live
// group state. Binding an arg REMOVES it from the action signature, so the placement seed has to
// be a local already in scope at that point (the generator emits arg lets in IDL order): the
// deleverage side seeds from its still-fuzzed `outflow_usd`, and the rate-limiter side -- whose
// other three args are all `Option<..>` or exactly-constrained, leaving nothing fuzzable -- seeds
// from `update_seq`, so placement walks the legal band as the batch counter advances. Either way
// the lag and ordering rejects and the sliding-window rollover on the success path are all
// reachable; `action_advance_clock` is what re-opens the window between batches.
// SAFETY CHECK (the setup-glue guidance): neither instruction is `init`; both only advance
// counters on the already-minted fixture group, so no sibling action's init target is affected.
// UpdateGroupRateLimiter.outflow_usd = Some(1_000u64)
// UpdateGroupRateLimiter.inflow_usd = Some(500u64)
// UpdateGroupRateLimiter.update_seq = self.scout_flow_next_seq(SCOUT_GROUP_RATE_LIMITER_LAST_SEQ_OFFSET)
// UpdateGroupRateLimiter.event_start_slot = self.scout_flow_window_start(SCOUT_GROUP_RATE_LIMITER_LAST_SLOT_OFFSET, update_seq)
// UpdateGroupRateLimiter.event_end_slot = self.scout_flow_window_end()
// UpdateDeleverageWithdrawals.update_seq = self.scout_flow_next_seq(SCOUT_GROUP_DELEV_LAST_SEQ_OFFSET)
// UpdateDeleverageWithdrawals.event_start_slot = self.scout_flow_window_start(SCOUT_GROUP_DELEV_LAST_SLOT_OFFSET, outflow_usd as u64)
// UpdateDeleverageWithdrawals.event_end_slot = self.scout_flow_window_end()

