// per-seed limit (MAX_SEED_LEN). `create_program_address` therefore errors for the seed itself,
// independent of bump, so `find_program_address` exhausts all 256 bumps and panics host-side
// with "Unable to find a viable program address bump seed" -- confirmed by direct execution: a
// `catch_unwind` around each of action_kamino_deposit's individual PDA derivations isolated the
// panic to exactly this one call, and every sibling derivation in the same action succeeded.
// This is why kamino_deposit's dispatch wrapper shows 0 calls (not just an inlined-handler
// measurement gap like other instructions in this queue): the harness panics constructing the
// account list, before a transaction is ever built or sent, so the action never even reaches
// `.send()`. Cannot edit the existing 35-byte seed line above (append-only); this ≤32-byte
// replacement fixes the SAME PDA derivation.
