//   + collected_group_fees(16) + total_liability_shares(16) = 8 + 264 -> total_asset_shares,
// which is exactly the already-proven SCOUT_BANK_TOTAL_ASSET_SHARES_OFFSET P-0002 reads. The two
// constants below are therefore cross-checked against a known-good landmark in the same struct.
