// have to infer its element type across the arms. Every read of it goes through `.get(..)`, which
// yields `None` on this value, so an unreadable account decodes to zero bytes rather than
// panicking, and the hook records the observation as invalid.
const SCOUT_HOOK_NO_BYTES: &[u8] = &[];



