// emissions/configure instruction in this harness is actually bound to. A wrapping ring would let
// a long lineage that creates banks evict exactly the subjects the property exists to watch. With
// a saturating cursor the overflow behaviour is instead "stop registering NEW banks" -- a false
// negative on late creations, never a lost subject and never a false positive.
const SCOUT_P13_BANK_CAP: usize = 64;
// Capacity of P-0030's fee-counter baseline registry (one Pubkey + three I80F48 bit patterns per
// slot, 80 bytes). Same fixed-array shape as SCOUT_P13_BANK_CAP and for a stricter reason: the
