// ---- P-0015 (the deleverage daily-withdrawal window) ------------------------------------------
//
// THE MECHANISM, read out of the program rather than assumed. `MarginfiGroup`
// (type-crate/src/types/group.rs:52) carries one `WithdrawWindowCache` (:84-88):
//     daily_limit: u32, withdrawn_today: u32 /* "in USD, approximate and rounded" */,
//     last_daily_reset_timestamp: i64
