        // lending_pool_withdraw_fees's `dst_token_account` (collect_bank_fees.rs:324-328) is not
        // program-created and has no PDA seeds; it only needs to be a real SPL TokenAccount of the
        // bank mint so Anchor can deserialize it and the SPL transfer CPI accepts it. SAFETY CHECK:
        // the only same-name scout accounts are lending_pool_withdraw_fees and
        // lending_pool_withdraw_insurance, both `init: false`/`pda: None`; this binding below is
        // instruction-qualified to the fee-withdraw action, so this setup account cannot disable
