            // the MarginfiAccounts this harness has minted. Recorded HERE, by the instruction that
            // creates the account, so that no predicate has to grow a registry as a side effect of being
            // evaluated -- a predicate that did would make its own verdict depend on how many times it
            // had run before, and would reach a different verdict on replay. One block per property so
