    // config requires EXACTLY 2 (`[oracle, reserve]`, state/price.rs:227-229/241-245) --
    // confirmed by direct execution (WrongNumberOfOracleAccounts) before this round's fix; (2)
    // `scout_ensure_kamino_oracle()` returns a bare PDA with no minted PriceUpdateV2 data, so
    // even attaching it as a remaining account would fail the owner/discriminator check inside
    // `PythPushOraclePriceFeed::load_checked`. Both are pure account-construction gaps in the
    // GENERATED action, not fixable by editing its existing body in place (a single, already-
    // written function whose lines cannot be edited under the append-only region contract).
    // This wrapper is mechanically the SAME instruction/binding shape (real bank_seed arg,
    // same PDA formulas, scout_ensure_kamino_reserve() -- now backed by REAL MinimalReserve
    // bytes at that exact PDA since this round's kamino_deposit/kamino_withdraw fixtures mint it
