    // SCOUT_COLLECT_BANK_FEES_*_OFFSET constants that `scout_prepare_collect_bank_fees` and P-0003
    // already use (re-verified against the repr(C) layout, and identical to the numbers P-0029's
    // `scout_p29_read_bank` derives independently); the subject-registry shape, the dirty-tracker
    // scoping and the setup-time seeder are P-0013's; the "one probe writes, the predicate only
