    // TWO ARMS, AND WHY THE FIRST NEEDS NO MEMORY. `Bank::new` zeroes all three counters, so zero
    // is a previous value that is known WITHOUT a probe -- the creation baseline. Since every
    // [rationale condensed for delivery — full derivation in git history]
    //     (SCOUT:EXTRA-ACTIONS) fabricates a 1_000/2_000/3_000 floor on `self.bank`'s three
    //     counters via `update_account` on every dispatch of
