    //     baselines, and the decrement arm skips `self.bank` for precisely the windows in which a
    //     payout succeeded. A FAILED collect commits nothing and does not bump the counter, so it
    //     does not open the window. Keeping `self.bank` in scope matters: it is the one bank every
    //     borrow, repay, withdraw, liquidation and interest accrual in this fixture is bound to,
