    // called at the end of setup() and by `action_share_value_monotonicity_probe`, into plain
    // `Copy` fixture arrays that crucible's stateful pool restores in lockstep with the SVM delta
    // they describe. This is P-0030's shape exactly; the probe sends no transaction, so it cannot
    // land inside its own measurement window.
