    //     withdraw handlers (marginfi_account/withdraw.rs:143, kamino:133, drift:162, solend:125),
    //     and the group is loaded `load_mut()` behind `#[account(mut)]` (withdraw.rs:69, :224-230)
    //     so its writes really do persist -- ruling out "the field is vestigial".
    //   * The check IS on the running total (`withdrawn_today > daily_limit` AFTER the add), not
    //     on the single withdrawal -- ruling out the second candidate failure in the brief.
